Horizon Weaver OS
Experimental native agent layer developed for Pop Stars AI LLC.

This work is derived from AgenticLinux:
https://github.com/ericcurtin/agenticlinux
Upstream source is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The upstream LICENSE is retained unchanged. Horizon Weaver additions are also
provided under Apache-2.0. Bundled third-party packages retain their own licenses.

The Horizon Weaver v0.1 changes add Markdown agent definitions, reusable skills,
systemd supervision, a read-only MCP server, an inference-gateway configuration,
an experimental planning loop, tests and documentation. The upstream bootc,
bootguard, Docker/Sandboxes, GPU and atomic-update implementations are retained.
